{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2021-05-05 07:45:00', 'title': 'JACOBS SECURES CONSULTANT ROLE ON MALAYSIA-SINGAPORE RAPID TRANSIT SYSTEM', 'text': 'DALLAS, MAY 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0JACOBS (NYSE:J) WAS SELECTED BY RTS OPERATIONS SDN BHD TO DELIVER SYSTEMS CONSULTANCY SERVICES TO HELP SHAPE THE FUTURE OF RAPID TRANSIT BETWEEN MALAYSIA AND SINGAPORE AND REDEFINE THE TRAVEL EXPERIENCE OF TENS OF THOUSANDS OF PASSENGERS WHO MAKE THE TRIP\xa0BETWEEN THE TWO CITIES ACROSS THE STRAIT ON A DAILY BASIS. AS SYSTEMS CONSULTANT, JACOBS WILL LEVERAGE LEADING DIGITAL DESIGN, COMPLIANCE AND RISK MANAGEMENT, AND ASSET MANAGEMENT TOOLS TO DELIVER CONSULTANCY SERVICES FOR THE DESIGN, MANUFACTURING, DELIVERY, TESTING AND COMMISSIONING OF ALL SYSTEMS FOR A NEW 2.5-MILE (4-KILOMETER) LIGHT RAIL LINE – THE JOHOR BAHRU TO SINGAPORE RAPID TRANSIT SYSTEM (RTS) LINK.'}{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2021-05-05 07:45:00', 'title': 'JACOBS SECURES CONSULTANT ROLE ON MALAYSIA-SINGAPORE RAPID TRANSIT SYSTEM', 'text': 'DALLAS, MAY 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0JACOBS (NYSE:J) WAS SELECTED BY RTS OPERATIONS SDN BHD TO DELIVER SYSTEMS CONSULTANCY SERVICES TO HELP SHAPE THE FUTURE OF RAPID TRANSIT BETWEEN MALAYSIA AND SINGAPORE AND REDEFINE THE TRAVEL EXPERIENCE OF TENS OF THOUSANDS OF PASSENGERS WHO MAKE THE TRIP\xa0BETWEEN THE TWO CITIES ACROSS THE STRAIT ON A DAILY BASIS. AS SYSTEMS CONSULTANT, JACOBS WILL LEVERAGE LEADING DIGITAL DESIGN, COMPLIANCE AND RISK MANAGEMENT, AND ASSET MANAGEMENT TOOLS TO DELIVER CONSULTANCY SERVICES FOR THE DESIGN, MANUFACTURING, DELIVERY, TESTING AND COMMISSIONING OF ALL SYSTEMS FOR A NEW 2.5-MILE (4-KILOMETER) LIGHT RAIL LINE – THE JOHOR BAHRU TO SINGAPORE RAPID TRANSIT SYSTEM (RTS) LINK.'}{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2021-05-05 07:45:00', 'title': 'JACOBS SECURES CONSULTANT ROLE ON MALAYSIA-SINGAPORE RAPID TRANSIT SYSTEM', 'text': 'DALLAS, MAY 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0JACOBS (NYSE:J) WAS SELECTED BY RTS OPERATIONS SDN BHD TO DELIVER SYSTEMS CONSULTANCY SERVICES TO HELP SHAPE TH